<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">What makes an AEO platform truly comprehensive?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">A comprehensive AEO platform addresses all four GEO layers: AEO, Reputation, Agentic, and Commerce. It provides integrated tools for content optimization, multi-engine analysis, brand monitoring, and strategic positioning across multiple AI systems with clear implementation methodology.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">Are all GEO layers equally developed in current platforms?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">No, most current platforms concentrate value in the AEO layer, with three of the four GEO layers not yet fully available. The AEO foundation is most mature, while Reputation, Agentic, and Commerce layers are still developing across the industry.</p>
</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">How important is multi-engine analysis in comprehensive platforms?</h3>
