</div>
<div class="border-b border-white/10 py-6">
<h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[#F8F8F8] mb-2">Should I choose a comprehensive platform or specialized tools?</h3>
<p class="text-white/70">This depends on organizational needs and resources. Comprehensive platforms offer integrated workflows and unified data, while specialized tools may provide deeper functionality in specific areas. Consider your team's expertise, budget, and long-term AI optimization strategy when choosing.</p>
</div>
</section>

